license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/howardhuang11-dotcom/kspilot"
abstract: >-
  kspilot is an autonomous flight system for the spaceflight game Kerbal Space
  Program. Through the kRPC interface it launches a vehicle to a commanded
  orbit, releases the payload, and returns the core stage to a powered
  vertical landing on the launch pad. The release includes the flight
  software, an in-game helper plugin, offline tests and simulators, vehicle
  definitions, and a technical report with the analysis script that
  regenerates its statistics from the raw flight records.
keywords:
  - autonomous landing
  - powered descent guidance
  - return to launch site
  - reusable launch vehicle
  - Kerbal Space Program
  - kRPC
